1
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:22,980
This small room, a lonely view,

2
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,340
grey skies over Shibuya,

3
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:31,660
raindrops on the window pane,

4
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,740
a familiar, soft refrain,

5
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,780
whispering your name again

6
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:43,200
across the miles, across the pane.

7
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,980
Tokyo lights begin to gleam,

8
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,700
lost inside a waking dream,

9
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:52,840
every drop of memory of you,

10
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,900
so far from me.

11
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:59,040
Oh, the city rain falls down

12
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,500
on this quiet Tokyo town,

13
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:04,780
each drop of tear I can't explain,

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,360
wishing you were here again,

15
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:14,160
my heart aches with this sweet, sad strain.

16
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:21,360
Neon signs and blurry streaks,

17
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:23,460
reflecting on the wet streets,

18
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:26,180
umbrellas pass a hurry pace,

19
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:28,960
no one sees my lonely face,

20
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:33,000
lost in time, lost in this place,

21
00:01:33,740 --> 00:01:36,480
searching for your gentle grace.

22
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:40,800
Tokyo lights begin to gleam,

23
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:43,060
lost inside a waking dream,

24
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:46,280
every drop of memory of you,

25
00:01:46,380 --> 00:01:48,300
so far from me.

26
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:52,380
Oh, the city rain falls down

27
00:01:52,380 --> 00:01:54,860
on this quiet Tokyo town,

28
00:01:55,180 --> 00:01:58,140
each drop of tear I can't explain,

29
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:02,680
wishing you were here again,

30
00:02:03,220 --> 00:02:07,540
my heart aches with this sweet, sad strain.

31
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:14,560
The piano plays a soft lemon,

32
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:16,820
a gentle, mournful sentiment,

33
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:19,420
my acoustic guitar weeps low,

34
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,940
where did our happy moments go,

35
00:02:22,140 --> 00:02:22,800
this longing?

36
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:27,360
It continues to grow.

37
00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:34,060
Empty chair beside me now,

38
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:36,480
I trace your smile upon my brow,

39
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:39,000
this apartment feels so vast,

40
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:41,380
shadows from a fading past,

41
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:43,640
how long will this feeling last?

42
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:47,200
My anchor, you're my mask.

43
00:02:51,140 --> 00:02:55,500
Oh, the city rain falls down

44
